    "rowKey": "New Land Beyond\n\nThe Master\nBullseye Bolster\nSnapshot Sights\n↑Top Tier Mastery",
    "section": "Kinetic Slot Weapons",
    "snapshot": {
      "plain": "Kinetic Bolt-Action Sniper Rifle.\n\nFires a bullet that deals 970 [155] Kinetic Damage with a 2.75x Precision Multiplier, followed by a rechamber that scales based on the Reload Speed.\nRechamber animation can be skipped following the \"clink\" noise by sprinting, allowing for considerably faster fire rate.\n\nRechamber Speed:\nBase Rechamber Speed allows firing every 1.834 seconds.\nBullseye Bolster allows firing every 1.49 seconds.\n100 Reload Speed allows firing every 1.35 seconds.\n 100 Reload Speed + Bullseye Bolster allows firing every 1.275 seconds.\n100 Reload Speed + Rechamber Cancelling + Bullseye Bolster allows firing every ~1.05 seconds.\n\nUpon scoring a Precision Hit:\nGrants a stack of The Master, up to a maximum of 100 until death.\nBullseye Bolster | +30 Handling, +40 Reload Speed, +2.2° to Aim Assist Cone, and 0.92x Rechamber Delay for 3.5 seconds.\nBullseye Bolster Stat Buff is removed upon scoring a Bodyshot, on stow, or upon firing without being ADS.\n\nThe Master:\nGrants increased Precision Damage, up to 70% at 20 stacks. \nx1 = 15.7% | x2 = 22.2% | x3 = 27% | x4 = 31.3% | x5 = 35%\nx10 = 49.5% | x15  = 60.6% | x20 = 70%\nFormula: 70% x √ ( Stack / 20 )\n\nRenames to The Grandmaster upon reaching 20 stacks, slowly increasing up to 73% over 100 stacks. Shots visually explode while at 20+ stacks.\n Transforms into THE GRANDERMASTER at 100 stacks. Transforms into The Chief Master at 999 stacks.\n\n↑Top Tier Mastery: While at >20 Master stacks:\nMagazine is constantly refilled, effectively removing reloading requirements.\nBullseye Bolster duration is increased to 5.5 seconds seconds.",
